    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/e7d47e8c93617508f07f6d98eddfd2de.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span>One fateful night, Yuri Maishima awakens her latent power to transform into the magical girl Angel Tear. Alongside her partner, Holy Rouge, she fights against the Demon God and his minions, protecting innocent people from harm. However, evil energy is seeping through the Demon Realm, corrupting the people she's supposed to protect! To make matters worse, others plot against her from the shadows, intent on using Angel Tear for their own gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out before all of humanity succumbs to demons' corruption. Can Yuri master her powers, keep her true identity a secret, and save the world? Or will she fall into the hands of evil? Uncover her fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/539cb7938982612ee06a50fcb49803a6.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span>Experience a rich, branching story through three separate perspectives. Many twists and turns await, and the story unfolds differently based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to guide the heroines to their salvation... or their demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/c73983e1f9ab2d940cc028a8962ee726.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/fd8cc3724cdddee8606e7adcb67ff3cf.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/4186360d468f8cbee217990143b18f84.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/9fdcd7d1cb535f621b3efe08a6bbe5a9.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span><strong>An Expansive Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel is jam-packed with mystery, drama, and action. There are over ten different routes and even more endings to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn sprites and illustrations, unique monster and demon designs, and dazzling transformation sequences in classic magical girl fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Voice Acting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant cast of voice actresses gives life to the characters with performances full of emotion and passion. Love, hate, courage, pain, despair\u2014it's all here!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/e7d47e8c93617508f07f6d98eddfd2de.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span>One fateful night, Yuri Maishima awakens her latent power to transform into the magical girl Angel Tear. Alongside her partner, Holy Rouge, she fights against the Demon God and his minions, protecting innocent people from harm. However, evil energy is seeping through the Demon Realm, corrupting the people she's supposed to protect! To make matters worse, others plot against her from the shadows, intent on using Angel Tear for their own gain.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time is running out before all of humanity succumbs to demons' corruption. Can Yuri master her powers, keep her true identity a secret, and save the world? Or will she fall into the hands of evil? Uncover her fate!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/539cb7938982612ee06a50fcb49803a6.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span>Experience a rich, branching story through three separate perspectives. Many twists and turns await, and the story unfolds differently based on your choices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you to guide the heroines to their salvation... or their demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/c73983e1f9ab2d940cc028a8962ee726.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/fd8cc3724cdddee8606e7adcb67ff3cf.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/4186360d468f8cbee217990143b18f84.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2420640/extras/9fdcd7d1cb535f621b3efe08a6bbe5a9.avif?t=1748511907\" /></span><strong>An Expansive Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel is jam-packed with mystery, drama, and action. There are over ten different routes and even more endings to explore!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stunning Visuals</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn sprites and illustrations, unique monster and demon designs, and dazzling transformation sequences in classic magical girl fashion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stellar Voice Acting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vibrant cast of voice actresses gives life to the characters with performances full of emotion and passion. Love, hate, courage, pain, despair\u2014it's all here!</p>",
